<div type="letter">
<pb facs="1038568" n="170r"/>
  <p><lb/>Quoniam nihil hactenus mihi scribendum occurrebat, ideo <add>distuli</add> responsionem
      <lb/>ad ultimas Tuas <rs type="letter" key="B_991170517037005501">literas</rs> gratissimas;<del> hunc di</del> nunc autem quia festum
      <lb/>Ascensionis instat et vacationes nostr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> inceperunt, Tibi significo,
      <lb/>quod amicissim<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> Tu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> invitationi morem gerere et ad Te venire
      <lb/>constitui, Tecum aliquandiu co<choice><orig><g ref="#mm">&#xE5D2;</g></orig><reg>mm</reg></choice>oraturus<del> est</del> et studiis operam daturus.
      <lb/>Faxit Deus ut Te salvum et incolumem inveniam.</p> <closer><salute>Vale igitur et me,
      <lb/>ut facis, amare perge.</salute>
                                    <dateline><rs type="place" key="place_GEO-3171728"><abbr>Patav.</abbr></rs> <abbr>d.</abbr> <date when="1719-05-14">14. Mai<choice><orig><g ref="#j">j</g></orig><reg>i</reg></choice> <choice><orig><g ref="#ndot">.</g></orig><reg/></choice>1719.</date></dateline></closer>
</div>
</body>
</text></TEI>